  <revision rev="4" vrev="2">
    <srcmd5>eeebad6ba891810df0894d599a823273</srcmd5>
    <version>1.11.7</version>
    <time>1790166969</time>
    <user>anag_factory</user>
    <comment>Add the missing python-pycountry dependency. Upstream requires
pydantic-extra-types[pycountry], and the spec dropped the extra, so any tokenizer
import failed with 'The language_code module requires &quot;pycountry&quot;'. This broke
consumers such as python-sglang (via gguf).

Also switch to libalternatives, and extend %check to import the tokenizer so a
missing runtime dependency fails the build.</comment>
    <requestid>1379915</requestid>
  </revision>
